<title>ARGENTINA: ARGENTINE CENTRAL BANK SETS NO OVERNIGHT REPOS.</title>
<headline>ARGENTINE CENTRAL BANK SETS NO OVERNIGHT REPOS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Thursday it did not allocate any overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money fell to 6.70 percent from 6.90 percent at the close Wednesday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar was flat at 0.99981 peso from Wednesday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
